REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

# LIFE_CELL_SQS — SQS squalene synthase after SQS on BA continuum
# Continuum ...->pcca->mcee->mut->suclg1->sdha->fh->mdh->cs->aco2->idh2->ogdh->scs->dld->dlst->oxct1->acat1->hmgcs2->hmgcl->bdh1->slc16a1->slc16a7->emb->aacs->hmgcs1->hmgcr->mvk->pmvk->mvd->idi1->fdps->sqs->sqs (SQS after SQS)
# Gift: SQS opens 2xFPP -> squalene synthase gate under ASSERT after SQS open.
# Domain: post-SQS squalene synthase (SQS/FDFT1) sterol-entry gate.
# Cube is SoT. Free energy must flow. Not a dual ladder.

ENTITY mito OF Cell 1 44 0
ENTITY peri OF Cell 1 28 0
ENTITY ash OF Cell 0 18 0
ENTITY starve OF Cell 1 0 0
ENTITY nest OF Cell 1 52 0

SEND mito set_threshold 10
SEND peri set_threshold 12
SEND nest set_threshold 8
SEND starve set_threshold 10

SEND mito pulse 5
SEND mito photosynth 42
SEND mito glycolyse 34
SEND mito pump 26
SEND mito photophos 24
SEND mito charge 38
SEND mito feed 36
